those parts; see README.md, "License", for which openclaw-nix outputs use each one.

- OpenClaw (https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw): MIT. The gateway, CLI and
  runtime plugins this repository builds are OpenClaw.
- nix-openclaw (https://github.com/openclaw/nix-openclaw): GNU Affero General Public
  License v3.0, with no additional permissions. Used as a flake input: its gateway
  source recipe, its gateway build scripts (copied into the build and edited), its
  runtime-plugin builder and generated locks, its overlay and its Home Manager module.
  Nothing from it is vendored in this repository.
- nixpkgs (https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs): MIT.
- Runtime plugins and their npm dependencies: each under its own license, as published
  to npm; pins/runtime-plugins.json lists them.
